%% Upload + ingestion pipeline
%% Sync (top): publisher uploads master directly to S3
%% Async (bottom): event-driven processing fans out, then finalize

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Pub as Publisher portal
    participant API as Upload service
    participant S3 as S3
    participant Bus as Kafka / SQS
    participant V as Validate worker
    participant F as Fingerprint worker
    participant T as Transcode worker (FFmpeg)
    participant Fin as Finalize worker
    participant Cat as Catalog (Postgres)
    participant Idx as Search indexer
    participant CDN as CDN

    Note over Pub,API: Synchronous upload phase
    Pub->>API: POST /uploads {filename, size, checksum}
    API->>S3: CreateMultipartUpload
    API-->>Pub: {upload_id, presigned part URLs}
    Pub->>S3: PUT part 1..N (parallel, resumable)
    Pub->>API: POST /uploads/{id}/complete
    API->>S3: CompleteMultipartUpload
    API->>Cat: insert track row (status=PROCESSING)
    S3-->>Bus: ObjectCreated event

    Note over Bus,Fin: Async processing (fan-out, then join)
    Bus->>V: dispatch
    V->>S3: ffprobe master
    V-->>Bus: validate.ok / validate.fail

    Bus->>F: dispatch
    F->>S3: read master
    F->>F: chromaprint / ACRCloud lookup
    F-->>Bus: fingerprint.ok / fingerprint.blocked

    Bus->>T: dispatch
    T->>S3: read master
    T->>T: HLS encode 96/128/256 kbps + LUFS norm + waveform
    T->>S3: write derived /track_id/v1/...
    T-->>Bus: transcode.complete

    Bus->>Fin: validate.ok + fingerprint.ok + transcode.complete
    Fin->>Cat: status=READY, hls_manifest_url=...
    Cat-->>Bus: catalog.changes (CDC)
    Bus->>Idx: index update
    Idx->>Idx: bulk POST OpenSearch
    Fin->>CDN: pre-warm first segment from N regions
    Fin-->>Pub: webhook "track live"
